{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「隼太……」", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0647", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "终于，隼太开始不再多说什么，只是拍了拍我的肩头。", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是期末考试最后一天。", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "与美羽学姐持续数日的“学习会”也迎来结束。", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但我不会就此作罢。", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不再拘于过往，目光朝向前方。", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和过去青涩的我做出告别。", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "期末考试结束，我怀着解放的心情走向活动室。", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这时在饮水处，我看见了美羽学姐的身影。", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜溜」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0380", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵，凉快吗～♪」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1638", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐冲洗着小熊喵的脚，脸上依然笑容满盈。", "text_idx": 198, "plain": "学姐冲洗着小熊喵的脚，脸上依然笑容满盈。", "plain_idx": 198, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿咻，用毛巾擦擦脚～」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1639", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜～♪」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0381", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "每当小熊喵弄脏脚后，一定会找人为自己洗干净。", "text_idx": 203, "plain": "每当小熊喵弄脏脚后，一定会找人为自己洗干净。", "plain_idx": 203, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果不弄干净，就不会爬上学姐的脑袋。多亏这样，它也从未弄脏过我们的衣物。", "text_idx": 204, "plain": "如果不弄干净，就不会爬上学姐的脑袋。多亏这样，它也从未弄脏过我们的衣物。", "plain_idx": 204, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小熊喵能保持干净真是太好了～」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜溜～」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0382", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，新吾辛苦了，考试顺利吗？」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1640", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还是别问了」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜，都怪我」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1641", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，是我意志太过薄弱」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这几天净在学姐家放纵了。", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天开始必须自重了。", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾，今天也来我家吗？」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1642", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嗯，完全无法自重。", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果你不介意的话」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，那一起回去吧♪」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1643", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "尽管每天都在出洋相，但学姐的态度不曾改变过。", "text_idx": 222, "plain": "尽管每天都在出洋相，但学姐的态度不曾改变过。", "plain_idx": 222, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "必须尽早回应她这份温柔，以男人的姿态……", "text_idx": 223, "plain": "必须尽早回应她这份温柔，以男人的姿态……", "plain_idx": 223, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜～……」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0383", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……得给小熊喵洗洗澡了～」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": "「啊……得给小熊喵洗洗澡了～」", "plain_idx": 226, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1644", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜溜！」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0384", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「去学姐家里洗吗？」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的。小熊喵爱干净，还挺喜欢洗澡的，对吧？」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": "「是的。小熊喵爱干净，还挺喜欢洗澡的，对吧？」", "plain_idx": 231, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1645", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜～♪」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0385", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过学姐并不是把小熊喵养在家里。", "text_idx": 234, "plain": "不过学姐并不是把小熊喵养在家里。", "plain_idx": 234, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "果然还是忘不了那只病逝的小猫么。", "text_idx": 235, "plain": "果然还是忘不了那只病逝的小猫么。", "plain_idx": 235, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想小熊喵一定也想和学姐生活在一起……", "text_idx": 236, "plain": "我想小熊喵一定也想和学姐生活在一起……", "plain_idx": 236, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾要和小熊喵一起洗吗？」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1646", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，这有点……」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我会控制不住自己扑向学姐的。", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵呵，我也想和新吾两人一起洗的♪」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": "「呵呵呵，我也想和新吾两人一起洗的♪」", "plain_idx": 241, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1647", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "进入浴室前，我想先进入学姐！", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "产生这种想法的我，已经无法离开学姐了吧……", "text_idx": 244, "plain": "产生这种想法的我，已经无法离开学姐了吧……", "plain_idx": 244, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么了，纱凪。期末考试也考完了，在这里干什么……」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": "「怎么了，纱凪。期末考试也考完了，在这里干什么……」", "plain_idx": 246, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4416", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……没什么」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1408", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不会还放不下他吧？」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4417", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啰嗦」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1409", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我担心你……」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4418", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道，也感谢你」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1410", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4419", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
