{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且也经常和天羽学姐发短信吧？」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4421", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1413", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有啥烦恼你就说出来，我会听你倾诉的」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4422", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「该说是烦恼，还是自我厌恶……」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1414", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「自我厌恶？」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4423", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「自从告诉新吾手机号后……我就一直期待着他的消息」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": "「自从告诉新吾手机号后……我就一直期待着他的消息」", "plain_idx": 276, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1415", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「期待着他会给我打打电话发发短信」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1416", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4424", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有时夜里会很想听到他的声音。到底为什么啊……」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": "「有时夜里会很想听到他的声音。到底为什么啊……」", "plain_idx": 281, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1417", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉……你什么时候变成这种姑娘了」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": "「唉……你什么时候变成这种姑娘了」", "plain_idx": 283, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4425", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我自己也不知道。不过我确实被他改变了，不甘心」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": "「我自己也不知道。不过我确实被他改变了，不甘心」", "plain_idx": 285, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1418", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「女人，怎能陷身于情爱」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4426", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我觉得这是一种难得的体验」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1419", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哼，借此机会精通恋爱如何？」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4427", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「做不到」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1420", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「已经结束了。我最初也是最后的爱恋——」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": "「已经结束了。我最初也是最后的爱恋——」", "plain_idx": 295, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1421", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、啊，学姐，等……」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊？！」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1648", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……啊……呜……学姐……」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「射了好多……好厉害……」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1649", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……啊……」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今日挑战结束。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "又是被学姐榨干的一天。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "全身无力。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我闭上眼睛，感觉就要沉睡过去。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾眼神都迷离了……舒服么？」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1650", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放松后，学姐主动吻了上来。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，啾，嗯嗯……」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": "「嗯，啾，嗯嗯……」", "plain_idx": 311, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1651", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "舌头交缠着的同时，学姐的手也没停下。阴茎因精液而变得黏黏糊糊。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": "舌头交缠着的同时，学姐的手也没停下。阴茎因精液而变得黏黏糊糊。", "plain_idx": 313, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……再加把劲吧？」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1652", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、啊……」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在有节奏的刺激下，我不禁开始呻吟。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐沾满精液的手忘乎所以地揉弄着我的下体。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": "学姐沾满精液的手忘乎所以地揉弄着我的下体。", "plain_idx": 318, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾可爱的样子，让我多看看吧……」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1653", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……？！」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
